{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t黃大仙下邨龍光樓發生火警，一人死亡，事件中50人疏散。<br/>\n<br/>\n警方上午8時許接獲多人報案，指黃大仙下邨龍光樓發生火警，一個單位起火及冒出濃煙，消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，約半小時後將火救熄。救援人員其後在一個單位内發現一具屍體。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：汪溟曦\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T03:14:30.610437+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:44:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T11:13:48.337025+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T03:08:03.286286+00:00","content_hash":"dddbce1e9de1be4b3a9a669e328a6a21ccca4eac5cd888404ea09ef0eced2cdd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}